### Listar todos os parâmetros (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parametros
Accept: application/json

###

### Atualizar valor válido (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/parametros/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "valor": 3.9500000000
}

###

### Atualizar com valor nulo (400 Bad Request)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/parametros/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "valor": null
}

###

### Atualizar com id inexistente (404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/parametros/9999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "valor": 1.5000000000
}
